@startuml SEQ3 — Payment & Booking Creation
title SmartStays — Sequence Diagram (Part 3: Payment & Booking Creation)

skinparam sequenceArrowThickness 2
skinparam roundcorner 5
skinparam sequenceParticipantBackgroundColor #EEF4FF
skinparam sequenceParticipantBorderColor #4A6FA5

actor User
participant "React App" as React
participant "Spring Boot API\n:4040" as API
database "MySQL DB" as DB

== Submit Booking ==

User -> React : Fill payment details + confirm
React -> API : POST /bookings/book-room/{roomId}/{userId}\nAuthorization: Bearer <JWT>\nBody: {checkInDate, checkOutDate,\n  numOfAdults, numOfChildren}

API -> API : JWTAuthFilter.doFilterInternal()\n— extract + validate JWT\n— set SecurityContextHolder

alt JWT invalid or expired
  API --> React : 401 Unauthorized
  React --> User : Redirect to /login
else JWT valid
  API -> API : @PreAuthorize("hasAnyAuthority('ADMIN','USER')")
  API -> DB : SELECT bookings WHERE roomId = ?\nAND checkIn < existingCheckOut\nAND checkOut > existingCheckIn

  alt Room not available
    API --> React : 400 — Room not available for selected dates
    React --> User : Show error message
  else Room available
    API -> DB : INSERT INTO bookings\n(confirmationCode, status=CONFIRMED, ...)
    API -> DB : INSERT INTO payments\n(amount, status=SUCCESS, ...)
    API -> DB : INSERT INTO notifications\n(message, userId, ...)
    DB --> API : Saved Booking entity
    API --> React : 200 OK {bookingConfirmationCode}
    React --> User : Render confirmation screen with code
  end
end

== Cancel Booking ==

User -> React : Enter confirmation code on /find-booking
React -> API : GET /bookings/get-by-confirmation-code/{code}
API -> DB : SELECT booking WHERE code = ?
DB --> API : Booking (room, user, dates)
API --> React : 200 OK Booking
React --> User : Show booking details + Cancel button

User -> React : Click Cancel Booking
React -> API : DELETE /bookings/cancel/{bookingId}\nAuthorization: Bearer <JWT>
API -> API : Validate JWT + ownership check\nor ADMIN role
API -> DB : UPDATE booking SET status = CANCELLED
DB --> API : OK
API --> React : 200 OK — "Booking cancelled"
React --> User : Show cancellation confirmation

@enduml
